{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_37_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_37","textTraditional":"一、八年，春王正月，師次于郎，以俟陳人、蔡人。甲午，祠兵。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_37_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_37","textTraditional":"次不言俟，此其言俟何？託不得已也。祠兵者何？出曰祠兵，入曰振旅，其禮一也，皆習戰也。何言乎祠兵？為久也。曷為為久？吾將以甲午之日，然後祠兵於是。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_37_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_37","textTraditional":"二、夏，師及齊師圍成，成降于齊師。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_37_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_37","textTraditional":"成者何？盛也。盛則曷為謂之成？諱滅同姓也。曷為不言降吾師？辟之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_37_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_37","textTraditional":"三、秋，師還。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_37_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_37","textTraditional":"還者何？善辭也。此滅同姓何善爾？病之也，曰：師病矣。曷為病之？非師之罪也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_37_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_37","textTraditional":"四、冬十有一月癸未，齊無知弒其君諸兒。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}